Subject: [PATCH] feat(filtering): add NotZero operator

NotZero emits only the items that are not the zero value of their type.

Also adds tests, a godoc example, the docs/data page and the llms.txt
entry, and resyncs the sourceRef line numbers of the filtering docs that
moved in operator_filter.go.

Closes #74
